characteristics are that she loves to eat and has a problem waking up early."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from m3rryweather's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1503"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a6/a6366d85ca2469ba4fb5042488c2bba20536d2781da17e9686c9100dbdf278ca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b1/b193a71d6475027086ff7ea906b89e321d0b0b9b7d91b65c4211524ffe1d1db6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"金田 まひる","creatorId":"vndb:s485","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s485","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s485","name":"梶田 夕貴","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3233","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1504","characterName":"巴 有希奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1504"},"originalCharacterName":"巴 有希奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Yukina Tomoe is Shizuma’s other osananajimi and Makina’s older twin sister. However she is the complete opposite of Makina in terms of personality. She is more mature and academically proficient but does not have much athletic ability. Even though she is more mature than her sister, she does show her “angry” smile when Makina goes out of bounds, scaring her witless. She also has strange quirks in her personality such as an odd sense of fashion and her eagerness to give back-breaking massages. Yukina is a very good cook and likes gardening."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from m3rryweather's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1504"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a7/a72ac45b29e08e1037f5bb456eef42b9d3709f18b6358e5bcd6043cb10d1fb83.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fca76b3156ee4fea3cad6e790a6e7fcce295721e3541a32c0c2870e5c707d3f1.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松永 雪希","creatorId":"vndb:s452","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s452","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s452","name":"永見 はるか","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3228","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1505","characterName":"ティータ・Ｆ（フローレス）・ブラント","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1505"},"originalCharacterName":"ティータ・Ｆ（フローレス）・ブラント","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Tita “Flawless” Brandt lives right next to the Tomoe household and is the tsundere ojousama. Disregarding Shizuma, she is a good friend to everyone in the Tomoe household. She is in constant competition with both Yukina and Makina in sports and academics, but she usually ends up trailing behind. Nevertheless, Tita has spunk and is not afraid to speak out her mind. And despite her initial impression of Shizuma as a pervert, with lots of time she will also see his good qualities."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from m3rryweather's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1505"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/506b6651288e6b7cd283013e885580e27997f423b0b8ffd6d462b4a654b0f121.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/412614f4fad93c62a12830aaaef9af4f1cb47c141615b19ddeaaeb2276b94c5c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"吉川 華生","creatorId":"vndb:s807","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s807","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s807","name":"桜庭 わかな","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3234","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1509","characterName":"敷島・クルル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1509"},"originalCharacterName":"敷島・クルル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Krile “Kururu” Shikishima is a lycan loli and an academic genius. She is so damn smart that she has already skipped several grades. Krile loves to read books and she is currently the head of the library committee. She is also proficient in magic and she can prove it with Azu, her talking stuffed cat. Azu speaks like some kind of gang boss and loves to order Shizuma around even though it can’t really do anything. Krile responds to Azu’s wild yammerings with sudden acts of violence, leading it to squeal and scream while begging for mercy. They certainly are…a unique duo. Because she is always surrounded by others older than her, she develops a hidden desire to grow up quickly. If Shizuma captures her heart, her desire strengthens, wishing to be seen as a woman in his eyes. In a world where magic exists, that possibility can become a reality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from m3rryweather's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1509"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/13/13125aee1f5f99feb94dae113911e7ab76e1f2a9e1f0e2675e1a19139584cb9e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a2/a2838dc6916e9c31e17306421c4ea0da646f426d2fe19765886e839fa140414a.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"西田 こむぎ","creatorId":"vndb:s570","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s570","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s570","name":"西田こむぎ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3231","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c1544","characterName":"凛・リム＝ウェムス","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c1544"},"originalCharacterName":"凛・リム＝ウェムス","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Rin Lim Venus is an elfin college graduate aiming to be a school teacher. She is a big dojikko and it shows many times back at the boarding house and in her part-time job in a maid cafe. Coupled with her fear of men, going anywhere near Shizuma’s presence is like an accident waiting to happen."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from m3rryweather's review."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c1544"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad84dc86bfac2b1108820c5e58433ab9cee43968ca6e624b12d1c1217f9df263.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b4/b4d8da854203a012119fe3166467dcfa4e2dbb99d592a9c4e3f7e2d83c9fd534.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"松田 理沙","creatorId":"vndb:s471","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s471","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s471","name":"力丸 乃りこ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:3230","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c171280","characterName":"支倉 静真","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c171280"},"originalCharacterName":"支倉 静真","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identitySt